          "contents": "## C — Clarify\nUse the computational thinking skill of **Decomposition** to break down \nthe task into smaller features below:\n* \n* \n* \n* \n\n\n## H — Hone\n\n\n## A — Apply\n\n\n## T — Transfer\n\n",
